data/coastline.json
    Derived from Natural Earth's 1:50m coastline
    https://www.naturalearthdata.com/
    Public domain. Natural Earth asks for no attribution and grants no
    warranty; this project credits it anyway, on the settings page.

    The file is not a verbatim copy: tools/build_coastline.py rounds every
    coordinate to two decimal places and re-encodes it. Public domain source,
    so the derivative carries no obligation, and it is covered by section 1
    above as part of this repository.

