3. NOT BUNDLED
================================================================================

Space weather is read live from NOAA's Space Weather Prediction Center
(services.swpc.noaa.gov). Nothing from it is stored or redistributed here. As
a work of the United States government it is in the public domain, but this
project makes no claim over it and speaks for none of it.
